## Accounting and authority

Listed-stock subtotal 5740 µL. Historical external ethanol 25,000 µL is retained separately, not added again. Historical 4.900 mL listed stocks +25.000 mL ethanol +0.840 mL reported additions =30.740 mL; user-called 30 mL +0.840=30.840 mL. No invented 100 uL top-up. Historical Coumarin remains 200 µL of 20% DEP, fraction basis unspecified, regardless of today's 10% w/w DPG stock. No unknown spray losses, top-up or measured mass is fabricated.

Exact active ppm w/w is UNKNOWN: for measured mass m_i and mass fraction f_i, active ppm = 1e6 * m_i * f_i / total measured mass. For raw volume v_i in µL, m_i = v_i * measured density / 1000. Actual densities, some old stock fractions and Lilyreal ND constituent masses are unavailable. Model mass and OAV are proxies, not real mass or observed smell. Air OAV = vapor ppm / (air ODT ppb /1000), never a cross-medium ratio. A mixture's perceived contribution is not OAV percent.


